        <p>${aiName} relies heavily on structured information about brands, people, and organizations. Having a Wikipedia page, Google Knowledge Panel, detailed LinkedIn presence, and consistent schema.org structured data on your website all contribute to the structured knowledge that AI systems use to build accurate representations of your brand.</p>

