        <p>${aiName} reflects the sentiment of the content it was trained on. Brands with predominantly positive reviews, case studies, and endorsements from authoritative sources are more likely to appear in positive contexts in ${aiName} answers. Reputation management — generating authentic positive coverage — is a core GEO strategy.</p>

