        <p>${aiName} is designed to answer questions. Content structured around specific questions your audience asks — with clear, direct answers — is more likely to be drawn upon in ${aiName}'s responses. FAQ sections, how-to guides, and comparison pages that directly answer common queries are particularly effective GEO content formats.</p>

